{"name": "Insert Disc", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"153\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4658490/extras/649b0cba01766b692c7ad4bc478a5c25.avif?t=1787037765\" width=\"1024\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"462\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4658490/extras/d0cb79850bcbe8c51ff2183cc5bdd2cf.poster.avif?t=1787037765\" width=\"1024\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4658490/extras/d0cb79850bcbe8c51ff2183cc5bdd2cf.webm?t=1787037765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4658490/extras/d0cb79850bcbe8c51ff2183cc5bdd2cf.mp4?t=1787037765\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your goal is to reach the score quota by flicking the logo and bouncing off your collection of Stars. With the right combo of Stars, Pins, and a bit of luck, you too can make big number go up and finally hit that corner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perfect for those looking to wind down, while getting that sweet, sweet dopamine of satisfying bounces and ever increasing numbers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"70\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4658490/extras/be33f54e1084d27e743376c3c57d8e3a.avif?t=1787037765\" width=\"1024\"/></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Change the logo's trajectory by <strong>flicking</strong> it across the TV, then watch the chaos and flashy lights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Peggle/Pachinko-like</strong> satisfaction - Bounce the logo off your Stars for BEEG points</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>50+ Stars</strong>\u00a0- The pegs that give more points and activate unique effects the more you collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>30+ Pins</strong>\u00a0- Infinitely retriggerable items for almost infinite chain-reactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>30+ Events</strong> and <strong>Bosses</strong> to refine your carefully crafted builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lava lamp, DVD player, and other 2000's nostalgic references</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"462\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4658490/extras/1093c9d55aa9b2f7f57826c4c2510e7b.poster.avif?t=1787037765\" width=\"1024\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4658490/extras/1093c9d55aa9b2f7f57826c4c2510e7b.webm?t=1787037765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4658490/extras/1093c9d55aa9b2f7f57826c4c2510e7b.mp4?t=1787037765\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We added a claw machine too, because we like claw machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"158\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4658490/extras/1ff919f199810cbff43d0fddd95843f4.avif?t=1787037765\" width=\"1024\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hit Stars to earn massive points and start game-breaking chain reactions. Retrigger Pins as many times as you can through number of bounces or other conditions such as summoning more Stars. Hitting a corner can end up wiping the board with a horde of logo clones!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"96\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4658490/extras/c130a5b48f06f83ef42d8f4219152a4e.avif?t=1787037765\" width=\"512\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ultimately, we wanted to make a relaxing, even hypnotizing experience that captures some of that Saturday late night gaming feel, back when we had no responsibilities or bills to pay :')</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether mindlessly bouncing or mindfully planning\u00a0builds, just remember to pet the cat and have fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"462\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4658490/extras/4da1617d5eec2a6129ad6a1741618b61.poster.avif?t=1787037765\" width=\"1024\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4658490/extras/4da1617d5eec2a6129ad6a1741618b61.webm?t=1787037765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4658490/extras/4da1617d5eec2a6129ad6a1741618b61.mp4?t=1787037765\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "A DVD screensaver inspired roguelike where you flick the logo inside your CRT TV and hit pegs to rack up tons of points. Endless bouncing among the stars and chill ambience combine for a mind-numbingly satisfying experience. Maybe this time, the logo will hit the corner!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4658490/3d3f791428cd11a8db410246f63c370fadc787f9/header.jpg?t=1787037765", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Roguelike", "Score Attack", "Strategy", "Deckbuilding", "Casual", "Relaxing"], "developers": "Guava Duck Games", "publishers": "Guava Duck Games", "release_date": "2027", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4658490", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "17 August 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/8aKLSlZhpDk", "first_seen": 1786917600.0, "review_rank": 101}